":{"teams":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/rugby/team/_/id/14/fiji"}}}}},{"id":152578,"type":"team","uid":"s:300~t:27","guid":"2f86ad34-e79c-3086-84e8-1cc6dfb8147e","description":"Portugal","sportId":300,"teamId":27,"team":{"id":27,"description":"Portugal","abbreviation":"POR","shortDisplayName":"Portugal","links":{"mobile":{"teams":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/rugby/team/_/id/27/portugal"}},"web":{"teams":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/rugby/team/_/id/27/portugal"}}}}},{"id":790149,"type":"team","uid":"s:300~t:20","guid":"8f1df596-f841-35c8-9008-fd413f288bd0","description":"Italy","sportId":300,"teamId":20,"team":{"id":20,"description":"Italy","abbreviation":"ITA","shortDisplayName":"Italy","links":{"mobile":{"teams":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/rugby/team/_/id/20/italy"}},"web":{"teams":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/rugby/team/_/id/20/italy"}}}}},{"id":133855,"type":"topic","guid":"ce95b7c2-d374-44cb-38c8-ab15d703cafd","description":"news - uk rugby","sportId":0,"topicId":159}],"keywords":["Rugby","England","Ireland","Scotland","Wales","France","South Africa","Australia","New Zealand","Fiji","Portugal","Italy","news - uk rugby"],"story":"<p>The international rugby calendar is as full as ever with the Nations Championship set to resume in November.. </p>\n<p>England will host Australia, Japan and New Zealand at Twickenham, with the finals weekend also set to be hosted in south-west London.</p>\n<p>See below for a full list of international rugby fixtures. </p>\n<p><em>All times are UK unless stated.</em></p>\n<p><img src=\"http://a.espncdn.com/i/infographics/20160725_mlbrankfuture/greyline.png\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n<p><u><strong>Friday, Nov. 6, 2026</strong></u></p>\n<p><strong>Ireland 42-12 Argentina</strong><img src=\"http://a.espncdn.com/i/infographics/20160725_mlbrankfuture/greyline.png\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n<p><u><strong>Saturday, Nov. 7, 2026</strong></u></p>\n<p><strong>Italy vs. South Africa,</strong> Allianz Stadium, Turin. 11.40 a.m.</p>\n<p><strong>Scotland vs. New Zealand,</strong> Murrayfield Stadium, Edinburgh. 2.10 p.m.</p>\n<p><strong>Wales vs. Japan, </strong>Principality Stadium, Wales. 4.40 p.m.</p>\n<p><strong>France vs. Fiji,</strong> Groupama Stadium, Lyon. 8.10 p.m.</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://a.espncdn.com/i/infographics/20160725_mlbrankfuture/greyline.png\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n<p><u><strong>Sunday, Nov. 8, 2026</strong></u></p>\n<p><strong>England vs. Australia,</strong>  Allianz Stadium, Twickenham. 3.10 p.m.</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://a.espncdn.com/i/infographics/20160725_mlbrankfuture/greyline.png\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n<p><u><strong>Friday, Nov. 13, 2026</strong></u></p>\n<p><strong>France vs. South Africa,</strong> Stade de France, Paris. 8.10 p.m.</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://a.espncdn.com/i/infographics/20160725_mlbrankfuture/greyline.png\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n<p><u><strong>Saturday, Nov. 14, 2026</strong></u></p>\n<p><strong>Italy vs. Argentina,</strong> Stadio Luigi Ferraris, Genoa. 11.40 a.m.</p>\n<p><strong>Wales vs. New Zealand,</strong> Principality Stadium, Cardiff. 2.10 p.m.</p>\n<p><strong>England vs. Japan, </strong>Allianz Stadium, Twickenham. 4.40 p.m.</p>\n<p><strong>Ireland vs. Fiji, </strong>Aviva Stadium, Dublin. 8.10 p.m.</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://a.espncdn.com/i/infographics/20160725_mlbrankfuture/greyline.png\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n<p><u><strong>Sunday, Nov. 15, 2026</strong></u></p>\n<p>Scotland vs. Australia, Murrayfield Stadium, Edinburgh. 3.10 p.m.</p>\n\n\n<p><img src=\"http://a.espncdn.com/i/infographics/20160725_mlbrankfuture/greyline.png\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n<p><u><strong>Saturday, Nov. 21, 2026</strong></u></p>\n<p><strong>England vs. New Zealand, </strong>Allianz Stadium, Twickenham. 2.10 p.m.</p>\n<p><strong>Scotland vs. Japan,</strong> Murrayfield Stadium, Edinburgh. 2.10 p.m.</p>\n<p><strong>Ireland vs. South Africa</strong>, Aviva Stadium, Dublin. 4.40 p.m.</p>\n<p><strong>Italy vs. Fiji,</strong> Bluenergy Stadium, Udine. 4.40 p.m.</p>\n<p><strong>France vs. Argentina,</strong> Stade de France, Paris. 8.10 p.m.</p>\n<p><strong>Wales vs. Australia,</strong> Principality Stadium, Cardiff. 8.10 p.m.</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://a.espncdn.com/i/infographics/20160725_mlbrankfuture/greyline.png\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n\n\n<h2>Nations Championship finals weekend</h2>\n\n\n<p><em>All games played at Allianz Stadium, Twickenham.</em></p>\n<p><u><strong>Friday, Nov. 27, 2026</strong></u></p>\n<p>6th Northern vs. 6th Southern. 4.40 p.m.</p>\n<p>3rd Northern vs. 3rd Southern. 8.10 p.m.</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://a.espncdn.com/i/infographics/20160725_mlbrankfuture/greyline.png\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n<p><u><strong>Saturday, Nov. 28, 2026</strong></u></p>\n<p>5th Northern vs. 5th Southern. 1.10 p.m.</p>\n<p>2nd Northern vs. 2nd Southern 4.40 p.m.</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://a.espncdn.com/i/infographics/20160725_mlbrankfuture/greyline.png\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n<p><u><strong>Sunday, Nov. 29, 2026</strong></u></p>\n<p>4th Northern vs. 4th Southern. 1.10 p.m.</p>\n<p>1st Northern vs. 1st Southern. 4.40 p.m.</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://a.espncdn.com/i/infographics/20160725_mlbrankfuture/greyline.png\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n\n\n<h2>Six Nations</h2>\n\n\n<p><u><strong>Friday, Feb. 5, 2027</strong></u></p>\n<p>Ireland vs. England, Aviva Stadium, Dublin. 8.10 p.m.</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://a.espncdn.com/i/infographics/20160725_mlbrankfuture/greyline.png\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n<p><u><strong>Saturday, Feb. 6, 2027</strong></u></p>\n<p>Scotland vs. Italy, Murrayfield Stadium, Edinburgh. 2.10 p.m.</p>\n<p>France vs. Wales, Stade de France, Paris. 4.40 p.m.</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://a.espncdn.com/i/infographics/20160725_mlbrankfuture/greyline.png\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n<p><u><strong>Saturday, Feb. 13, 2027</strong></u></p>\n<p>Italy vs. Ireland, Stadio Olimpico, Rome 2.10 p.m.</p>\n<p>Scotland vs. Wales, Murrayfield Stadium, Edinburgh. 4.40 p.m.</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://a.espncdn.com/i/infographics/20160725_mlbrankfuture/greyline.png\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n<p><u><strong>Sunday, Feb. 14, 2027</strong></u></p>\n<p>England vs. France, Allianz Stadium, Twickenham. 3.10 p.m.</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://a.espncdn.com/i/infographics/20160725_mlbrankfuture/greyline.png\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n<p><strong><u>Saturday, Feb. 20, 2027</u></strong></p>\n<p>Wales vs. Ireland, Principality Stadium, Cardiff. 2.10 p.m.</p>\n<p>England vs. Italy, Allianz Stadium, Twickenham. 4.40 p.m.</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://a.espncdn.com/i/infographics/20160725_mlbrankfuture/greyline.png\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n<p><u><strong>Sunday, Feb. 21, 2027</strong></u></p>\n<p>France vs. Scotland, Stade de France, Paris. 3.10 p.m.</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://a.espncdn.com/i/infographics/20160725_mlbrankfuture/greyline.png\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n<p><u><strong>Friday, March 5, 2027</strong></u></p>\n<p>Scotland vs. Ireland, Murrayfield, Edinburgh. 8.10 p.m.</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://a.espncdn.com/i/infographics/20160725_mlbrankfuture/greyline.png\" width=\"100%\"><u><strong>Saturday, March 6, 2027</strong></u></p>\n<p>Italy vs. France, Stadio Olimpico, Rome. 2.10 p.m.</p>\n<p>Wales vs. England, Principality Stadium, 4.40 p.m.</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://a.espncdn.com/i/infographics/20160725_mlbrankfuture/greyline.png\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n<p><u><strong>Saturday, March 13, 2027</strong></u></p>\n<p>Italy vs. Wales, Stadio Olimpico, Rome. 2.10 p.m.</p>\n<p>England vs. Scotland, Allianz Stadium, Twickenham. 4.40 p.m.</p>\n<p>Ireland vs. France, Aviva Stadium, Dublin. 8.10 p.m.</p>\n\n\n\n\n","allowAMP":true,"allowAds":true,"allowComments":true,"allowCommerce":true,"allowContentReactions":true,"allowSearch":true,"byline":"ESPN","isLiveBlog":false,"links":{"api":{"self":{"href":"https://content.core.api.espn.com/v1/sports/news/42131438"}},"app":{"sportscenter":{"href":"sportscenter://x-callback-url/showStory?uid=42131438"}},"mobile":{"href":"http://m.espn.go.com/wireless/story?storyId=42131438"},"web":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/rugby/story/_/id/42131438/international-men-r